<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, NOV 27.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, NOV 27.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Wednesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Nov 27	Nov 26	DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  239.920     239.630     237.040    1.21 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  303.160     303.280     303.640   -0.16 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.260     157.270     165.490   -4.97 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.440	46.374	48.410   -4.07 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  402.300     401.200     366.280    9.83 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.170     140.240     147.886   -5.22 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.844	15.865	14.975    5.80 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  211.630     213.240     230.135   -8.04 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.869	 1.870	 1.939   -3.61 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.557	 1.560	 1.575    0.13 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  185.805     185.600     206.030   -9.82 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
